; EXODUS.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; ITEMS: chests, torches, negate time (58B4-5D83).
;
; Despite the name, the module holds a mix: data first (58B4-5B27), then small commands and
; helpers. Data: the shrine picture's file name, the dungeon Facing, the race table and the
; stat maxima the shrines use (RaceLetters, RaceStatMax), the 32 spell name pointers and the
; two spell jump tables (WizardSpellCmds, ClericSpellCmds: MAGIC's handlers), the facing and
; shrine name tables and most strings of MAGIC and SHRINE.
; Code: InExodusCastle (5B28), MoonGateJump (5B51), DexRoll (5B85), the commands Fire (5BCF,
; the frigate's cannons; docs/MAP.md calls it Get Chest, but G is 8190), Join gold (5C73),
; K/D on the surface (5CC3), Ignite a torch (5CC9), Negate time (5CF8), and the BCD helpers
; ReadKeyUpper, AddHitPoints, AddExp, AddGold (5D16-5D82).
; Map bytes are shape * 4 (+ 0-3 for a chest: what lies under it); the view buffer and
; creature names use the shape number (docs/FORMATS.md 2).
